      "label": "6.38.4, 5",
      "numbers": [
        4,
        5
      ],
      "devanagari": "लन्काम् च आलोकयिष्यामो निलयम् तस्य रक्षसह् |\nयेन मे मरण अन्ताय हृता भार्या दुरात्मना\nयेन धर्मो न विज्नातो न वृत्तम् न कुलम् तथा |\nराक्षस्या नीचया बुद्ध्या येन तद् गर्हितम् कृतम्",
      "iast": "lankām ca ālokayiṣyāmo nilayam tasya rakṣasah |\nyena me maraṇa antāya hṛtā bhāryā durātmanā\nyena dharmo na vijnāto na vṛttam na kulam tathā |\nrākṣasyā nīcayā buddhyā yena tad garhitam kṛtam",
      "translation": "\"We shall see Lanka the abode of that demon, Ravana the evil-minded by whom my wife was taken away for the sake of his own death, by whom virtue was not understood, good character was not known and noble lineage was not seen and by whom that contemptible act was done with an inferior demoniacal mind.\"",
