      "label": "6.38.7",
      "numbers": [
        7
      ],
      "devanagari": "एको हि कुरुते पापम् काल पाज़ वज़म् गतः |\nनीचेन आत्म अपचारेण कुलम् तेन विनज़्यति",
      "iast": "eko hi kurute pāpam kāla pāza vazam gataḥ |\nnīcena ātma apacāreṇa kulam tena vinazyati",
      "translation": "\"Falling into that power of trap of death, one does an evil act. Because of the offence committed by him the vilest, his lineage is destroyed.\"",
